diff --git a/evidence/verification-body-mutation.patch b/evidence/verification-body-mutation.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..b7eecc5709be9b1be9e9542b5c115dfc1b5533b4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/evidence/verification-body-mutation.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+--- verification.k
++++ verification-body-mutant.k
+@@
+-            Int(1)),
++            Int(2)),
+
+This changes the actual loop body loaded and executed by the entry claim from
+`(water + capacity - 1) // capacity` to
