+--- verification.k
++++ verification-body-mutant.k
+@@
+-            Int(1)),
++            Int(2)),
+
+This changes the actual loop body loaded and executed by the entry claim from
+`(water + capacity - 1) // capacity` to
+`(water + capacity - 2) // capacity`.  For grid `[[1]]`, capacity `2`, the
+mutant returns `0` while the claimed `maxFillSpec` is `1`.

